SharePoint Site URL:
    Every SharePoint site has its own URL/address.
    Example:
        https://contoso.sharepoint.com/sites/BudgetApproval
    
    Break it down:
        https:// → protocol
        contoso → organization's Microsoft 365/SharePoint tenant name
        sharepoint.com → SharePoint Online domain
        /sites/ → common managed path for sites
        BudgetApproval → particular site's URL name
    
    So:
        Tenant → contoso.sharepoint.com
        Site → /sites/BudgetApproval
    
    Full URL:
    https://contoso.sharepoint.com/sites/BudgetApproval
    
    Multiple sites
        A company could have:
        /sites/Finance
        /sites/HR
        /sites/BudgetApproval
        /sites/ITSupport
    Each represents a different SharePoint site.
